      "q_id": "RTAS065",
      "index": "RTS OG Meeting Room Situation",
      "title": "You booked a meeting room at the library from 2 p.m. to 3 p.m. to work on a group project. Now it’s just after 2 pm and your classmates will arrive soon but some other students are sitting in the meeting room. What would you say to them?",
